---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Terms of Service - NovaTools"
  description="Terms of service and usage conditions for NovaTools client-side utility suite."
>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 py-10 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 space-y-8">
    <div class="space-y-2 border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-white/[0.08] pb-5">
      <h1 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black tracking-tight text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Terms of Service</h1>
      <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-[#9ca3af] font-mono">Last Updated: {new Date().toLocaleDateString('en-US', { month: 'long', day: 'numeric', year: 'numeric' })}</p>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-5 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-[#d1d5db] leading-relaxed">
      <section class="space-y-2 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-white/[0.08] bg-white dark:bg-[#1e2025] p-5 sm:p-6 shadow-sm">
        <h2 class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white uppercase tracking-wider font-mono">1. Agreement to Terms</h2>
        <p>
          By accessing and using NovaTools (<a href="https://toolboxs.tech" class="text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 hover:underline">toolboxs.tech</a>), you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service. If you do not agree, discontinue use immediately.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-2 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-white/[0.08] bg-white dark:bg-[#1e2025] p-5 sm:p-6 shadow-sm">
        <h2 class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white uppercase tracking-wider font-mono">2. License & Client Runtime Execution</h2>
        <p>
          NovaTools grants you a free, non-exclusive license to use the browser-based utilities for personal and commercial media/document processing.
        </p>
        <p>
          Because all computation occurs directly on your client hardware, you are solely responsible for ensuring your machine has sufficient memory and CPU capacity to transcode target media.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-2 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-white/[0.08] bg-white dark:bg-[#1e2025] p-5 sm:p-6 shadow-sm">
        <h2 class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white uppercase tracking-wider font-mono">3. Disclaimer of Warranties</h2>
        <p>
          NovaTools is provided on an "AS IS" basis without warranties of any kind. While our in-browser processing algorithms are rigorously tested, we advise retaining original backups of all source files.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
